# Unit19
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit19核心词汇

grand/ɡrænd/宏伟的；重大的/The hotel has a grand entrance.
grant/ɡrænt/拨款；授予/The university received a large research grant.
grass/ɡræs/草/The children played on the grass.
grave/ɡreɪv/严重的；坟墓/This is a grave mistake.
gray/ɡreɪ/灰色的/His hair has turned gray.
great/ɡreɪt/伟大的；极好的/She is a great leader.
greedy/ˈɡriːdi/贪婪的/Don't be greedy and take more than your share.
green/ɡriːn/绿色的/The grass is green in spring.
greet/ɡriːt/问候/She greeted the guests at the door.
grief/ɡriːf/悲伤/She was overcome with grief after the loss.
grind/ɡraɪnd/磨碎/She ground the coffee beans in the machine.
grip/ɡrɪp/紧握/He gripped the rope tightly.
gross/ɡroʊs/总的；粗鲁的/The gross income was one million dollars.
ground/ɡraʊnd/地面/The ball fell to the ground.
group/ɡruːp/小组/They divided into groups for the discussion.
grow/ɡroʊ/生长/Plants grow faster in summer.
guarantee/ˌɡærənˈtiː/保证/The product comes with a two-year guarantee.
guard/ɡɑːrd/守卫/The guard stood at the entrance.
guess/ɡes/猜/Can you guess the answer?
guest/ɡest/客人/We have a guest staying with us this week.
guide/ɡaɪd/指南；导游/He works as a tourist guide.
guilty/ˈɡɪlti/有罪的；内疚的/He was found guilty of theft.
gun/ɡʌn/枪/The hunter carried a gun.
guy/ɡaɪ/家伙/He is a nice guy.
habit/ˈhæbɪt/习惯/Reading before bed is a good habit.
hair/her/头发/She has long black hair.
half/hæf/半/Half of the students are girls.
hall/hɔːl/大厅/They gathered in the school hall.
hand/hænd/手/She raised her hand to ask a question.
handle/ˈhændl/处理；把手/He can handle any situation calmly.
hang/hæŋ/悬挂/She hung the picture on the wall.
happen/ˈhæpən/发生/What happened to you yesterday?
happy/ˈhæpi/快乐的/She looks very happy today.
hard/hɑːrd/困难的；努力的/The exam was very hard.
hardly/ˈhɑːrdli/几乎不/I can hardly believe it.
harm/hɑːrm/伤害/Smoking does harm to your health.
harvest/ˈhɑːrvɪst/收获/It's time to harvest the crops.
haste/heɪst/匆忙/Haste makes waste.
hat/hæt/帽子/She wore a beautiful hat.
hate/heɪt/讨厌/I hate getting up early.
head/hed/头/He hit his head on the door.
headline/ˈhedlaɪn/头条新闻/The headline caught my attention.
health/helθ/健康/Good health is the most valuable thing.
hear/hɪr/听见/I can hear music coming from next door.
heart/hɑːrt/心；心脏/She has a kind heart.
heat/hiːt/热量；加热/The heat in summer is unbearable.
heavy/ˈhevi/重的/The box is too heavy for me to carry.
height/haɪt/高度/The building reaches a height of 100 meters.
help/help/帮助/Can you help me with this problem?
hero/ˈhɪroʊ/英雄/He is a real hero for saving the child.
